://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000121390026057130/0001213900-26-057130-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-05-11","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000162828026033500/0001628280-26-033500-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-04-17","form":"8-K","codes":["8.01"],"events":[{"label":"Other material event","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000121390026044918/0001213900-26-044918-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-04-03","form":"8-K","codes":["5.02"],"events":[{"label":"Director or officer departure or appointment","kind":"people","tone":"warn"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000121390026039995/0001213900-26-039995-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[{"date":"2022-09-06","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000095014222002665/0000950142-22-002665-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2022-09-06","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000119312522238960/0001193125-22-238960-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2022-08-01","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000114036122027705/0001140361-22-027705-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["Getty Images Holdings, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Business Services, NEC\", based in WA, and has been publicly reporting for 3 years.","It reported $925.6m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 1.1% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 70.8%.","Listed on NYSE, it funds itself from operations ($108.9m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Gross margin of 70.8% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001898496"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $108.9m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000162828026033481/0001628280-26-033481-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-033481"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (1.2% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000162828026033481/0001628280-26-033481-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-033481"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue grew only 1.1% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000162828026033481/0001628280-26-033481-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-033481"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 73.1% to 70.8% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001898496"},{"text":"Debt of $2.0bn against equity of $538.9m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000162828026033481/0001628280-26-033481-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-033481"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.6% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1898496/000121465926009102/0001214659-26-009102-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-mont